.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-openpgp-certificates 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-openpgp\-certificates \- Manage certificates
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-openpgp\-certificates\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage certificates
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ckman\-openpgp\-certificates\-import(1)
Import a certificate (PEM/DER) for a key slot
.TP
ckman\-openpgp\-certificates\-export(1)
Export the certificate of a key slot
.TP
ckman\-openpgp\-certificates\-delete(1)
Delete the certificate of a key slot (the key is retained)
.TP
ckman\-openpgp\-certificates\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
